		(property "Note" "R_IPROPI 6.8k: I_TRIP = VREF/(R*A_IPROPI) = 3.3/(6.8k*244uA/A) = 1.99 A (DRV8214 2 A RMS rating; SLVSH04 eq. 3, A_IPROPI_H = 244 uA/A at CS_GAIN_SEL=000b). V_IPROPI at 1.65 A stall = 2.74 V (ADC headroom). PROVISIONAL -> vault CALC"
